A community skin is its catalog entry (catalog/skins/<id>.json) and the recipes its
implementations name, with the glyph masks and other art they hold. The entry's "licence"
field states CC-BY-SA-4.0 and its "authors" field names who made it; a recipe a skin names is
named by no feature and no other skin.

Everything else in this repository, including feature recipes and the glyph masks they hold,
is licensed under the MIT licence in LICENSE.
